@startuml
title Process Sale State Machine

[*] --> WaitingForSale

state WaitingForSale
WaitingForSale : entry / Display Welcome Message

state AddingItems
AddingItems : do / Add items to sale

state Payment
Payment : do / Verify payment method

state VerifyingCardPayment
VerifyingCardPayment : do / Verify card payment

state VerifyingCheckPayment
VerifyingCheckPayment : do / Verify check payment

state CompletingSale
CompletingSale : do / Complete sale and return change

WaitingForSale --> AddingItems : New Sale Started [Customer selects first item]

AddingItems --> Payment : All items added [Customer completes selection]
Payment --> VerifyingCardPayment : Card selected for payment
VerifyingCardPayment --> CompletingSale : Payment approved
Payment --> VerifyingCheckPayment : Check selected for payment
VerifyingCheckPayment --> CompletingSale : Payment approved

CompletingSale --> WaitingForSale : Sale completed and customer leaves

@enduml
